    "methods_description": "EEG was recorded using EMOTIV EPOC X or EPOC+ devices at 14 scalp positions (AF3, F7, F3, FC5, T7, P7, O1, O2, P8, T8, FC6, F4, F8, AF4) sampled at 128 Hz. Participants completed a resting baseline (eyes-open and eyes-closed, 30 s each) followed by a food-image categorization task in which 37 prepared-food images were presented twice (~74 trials total). Participants responded via keyboard (M for meat, X for vegetarian), with response times recorded. No filtering or artifact rejection was applied during preprocessing.",
